 Safety Research Foundation", "channel_url": "https://rumble.com/c/VaccineSafetyResearchFoundation", "duration": 4375, "uploader": "Vaccine Safety Research Foundation", "live_status": "was_live", "webpage_url": "https://rumble.com/v6yps7u-episode-194-cdc-reckoning.html", "webpage_url_basename": "v6yps7u-episode-194-cdc-reckoning.html", "webpage_url_domain": "rumble.com", "extractor": "RumbleEmbed", "extractor_key": "RumbleEmbed", "release_timestamp": 1757631606, "view_count": 11559, "like_count": 173, "dislike_count": 1, "description": "Donations are tax deductible and we need your support to continue our work into 2024. Or to text-to-donate, text VSRF to 53-555Show more This week on VSRF Live -- CDC Reckoning with Dr. Robert Malone, MD, MS.\nDr. Malone is a physician, scientist, and the original inventor of mRNA vaccine technology. Throughout the pandemic, he became one of the most outspoken voices challenging government narratives and exposing censorship, corruption, and the politicization of science.\nNow, Dr. Malone has been appointed to the CDC’s powerful Advisory Committee on Immunization Practices (ACIP)—a panel that helps decide which vaccines are recommended for children and adults nationwide. His presence on the committee marks a major shift, bringing an independent scientific perspective into a group long criticized for conflicts of interest and ties to Big Pharma.\nOn Thursday, Dr. Malone will join Steve Kirsch to discuss:\n✅ The leadership shake-up at the CDC—and what it really means\n✅ How ACIP decisions impact every American family\n✅ Why restoring scientific integrity and transparency is urgent\n✅ His vision for reforming public health policy\n📅 Thursday, September 11\n⏰ 7pm ET | 4pm PT\n📍 Streaming Live on Rumble & X.\nLater in the show, Dr. Pierre Kory will join us to discuss the upcoming NYC vaccine debate on September 13th, where Steve and Dr. Kory will go head-to-head with Debunk the Funk’s Dr. Dan Wilson and “Professor” Dave Farina.\n👉 Don’t miss this important episode. Tune in and be part of the conversation!\nThank you for supporting VSRF and making it possible to bring truth-telling voices like Dr. Malone, Dr. Kory, and Steve Kirsch directly to you each week.” Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fww1/d6/s8/1/A/u/z/g/Auzgz.qR4e-small-Episode-194-CDC-Reckoning.jpg", "display_id": "v6wivz0", "fulltitle": "Episode 194: CDC Reckoning", "duration_string": "1:12:55", "upload_date": "20250909", "release_date": "20250911", "release_year": 2025, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777727938, "acodec": "aac", "vcodec": "none", "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fww1/d6/s8/2/A/u/z/g/Auzgz.Gaa.rec.aac", "format_id": "audio-192p", "tbr": 191, "filesize": 105019211, "width": 0, "height": 192, "protocol": "https", "ext": "aac", "audio_ext": "aac", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 191, "resolution": "audio only", "aspect_ratio": 0.0, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "audio-192p - audio only", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.01.31", "release_git_head": "9a9a6b6fe44a30458c1754ef064f354f04a84004", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}